  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Commission of Jurists (ICJ) Core Funding 2019-2021 to the implementation of ODA-relevant parts of ICJ&#x2019;s strategy, in line with ICJ five strategic goals:   1) Independence of Judges and Lawyers, 2) Access to Justice for All, 3) Accountability for Human Rights Violations adn Abuses,4) The rule og Law and International Human Rights Standardsa and Instruments. 5) Domestic Implementation and Compliance</narrative>
  </description>
